<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f1eb">
<title>윤수아 — Personal Data Atlas</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Gowun+Batang:wght@400;700&family=Pretendard:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f4f1eb;--paper:#fffdf8;--ink:#202820;--muted:#7d8479;--line:#dddcd2;--green:#496b58;--lime:#c6d77c;--orange:#e58b62;--blue:#91aeb6;--shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(36,48,38,.07)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:Pretendard,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.55}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:28px 26px 70px}
.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:15px}
.eyebrow,.mono{font:500 11px 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.dot{width:9px;height:9px;background:var(--orange);border-radius:50%}
.hero{padding:62px 0 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:30px;align-items:end}
.kicker{color:var(--green);font:500 12px 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.14em}
h1{font:700 clamp(44px,7vw,82px)/1.02 'Gowun Batang',serif;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:15px 0 17px}
.hero p{font-size:16px;color:#626b61;max-width:490px;margin:0}
.hero-art{min-height:205px;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.orbit{width:190px;height:190px;border:1px solid #b8c2b1;border-radius:50%;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center}
.orbit:before,.orbit:after{content:"";position:absolute;border:1px dashed #c6cbbb;border-radius:50%}
.orbit:before{inset:20px}.orbit:after{inset:43px}
.core{width:78px;height:78px;border-radius:26px;background:var(--green);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font:700 27px 'Gowun Batang',serif;z-index:1;box-shadow:0 9px 24px #496b5833}
.orbit-label{position:absolute;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:30px;font-size:11px;color:var(--green);z-index:2}
.ol1{top:8px;left:12px}.ol2{right:-8px;top:65px}.ol3{bottom:4px;left:25px}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin:0 0 18px}
.stat{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px 22px;min-height:112px}
.stat .num{font:700 34px 'Gowun Batang',serif;color:var(--green);margin-top:6px}
.stat .desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:18px}
.card{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:25px 26px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.card-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:22px}
.card h2{font:700 22px 'Gowun Batang',serif;margin:0}
.index{font:11px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:var(--muted)}
.interest-list{display:grid;gap:17px}
.interest{display:grid;grid-template-columns:105px 1fr 38px;gap:12px;align-items:center}
.interest strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
.track{height:11px;background:#ecece3;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden}
.fill{height:100%;border-radius:20px}
.fill.g{background:var(--green);width:100%}.fill.o{background:var(--orange);width:100%}.fill.b{background:var(--blue);width:100%}
.interest small{font:11px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:var(--muted);text-align:right}
.note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:20px 0 0;padding-top:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.focus{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:18px;background:#f1f2e9;border:1px solid #e2e5d8}
.heart{width:48px;height:48px;flex:0 0 48px;background:var(--lime);border-radius:16px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:23px}
.focus b{font:700 22px 'Gowun Batang',serif}.focus p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:2px 0 0}
.place{margin-top:15px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:17px}
.place strong{font-size:15px}.place span{font:11px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:var(--muted)}
.links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.link{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);transition:.2s;display:block;min-height:126px}
.link:hover{border-color:var(--green);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.link .symbol{font:500 18px 'DM Mono',monospace;color:var(--green)}
.link b{display:block;font-size:15px;margin:12px 0 3px}
.link small{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;word-break:break-all}
.profile-footer{margin-top:18px;background:var(--green);color:#f9f7ef;padding:24px 27px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}
.profile-footer p{margin:0;color:#dce6dc;font-size:13px}
.profile-footer strong{font:700 23px 'Gowun Batang',serif}
.footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:24px;color:var(--muted);font:10px 'DM Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em}
@media(max-width:760px){.wrap{padding:20px 15px 45px}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:43px 0 25px;gap:0}.hero-art{min-height:190px}.stats{gap:7px}.stat{padding:15px 12px;min-height:95px}.stat .num{font-size:28px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card{padding:21px 18px}.interest{grid-template-columns:88px 1fr 30px}.profile-footer{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.footer{gap:12px;flex-direction:column}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="wrap">
  <header class="top">
    <div class="mark"><span class="dot"></span><span class="eyebrow">Personal Data Atlas</span></div>
    <span class="mono">PROFILE / 2026</span>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">A SMALL COLLECTION OF ME · 01</div>
      <h1>안녕하세요,<br>윤수아입니다.</h1>
      <p>좋아하는 것과 소중하게 생각하는 것, 그리고 온라인에서 만들어가는 공간을 한눈에 정리한 개인 데이터 아틀라스입니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-label="세 가지 관심사를 표현한 원형 그래픽">
      <div class="orbit">
        <span class="orbit-label ol1">GUITAR</span><span class="orbit-label ol2">ANIMATION</span><span class="orbit-label ol3">MUSIC</span>
        <div class="core">수아</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stats" aria-label="프로필 요약">
    <article class="stat"><div class="eyebrow">INTERESTS</div><div class="num">03</div><div class="desc">등록된 관심 분야</div></article>
    <article class="stat"><div class="eyebrow">DIGITAL SPACE</div><div class="num">02</div><div class="desc">GitHub · GitHub Pages</div></article>
    <article class="stat"><div class="eyebrow">MY TREASURE</div><div class="num">01</div><div class="desc">가장 소중한 존재</div></article>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><h2>관심사의 스펙트럼</h2><span class="index">01 / INTERESTS</span></div>
      <div class="interest-list">
        <div class="interest"><strong>기타</strong><div class="track"><div class="fill g"></div></div><small>01</small></div>
        <div class="interest"><strong>애니메이션</strong><div class="track"><div class="fill o"></div></div><small>02</small></div>
        <div class="interest"><strong>음악 감상</strong><div class="track"><div class="fill b"></div></div><small>03</small></div>
      </div>
      <p class="note">자기소개에 기재한 관심 키워드 3가지를 동일한 비중으로 표현했습니다. 순위나 선호도 수치는 아닙니다.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><h2>나의 중심</h2><span class="index">02 / PERSONAL</span></div>
      <div class="focus">
        <div class="heart">♡</div>
        <div><div class="eyebrow">MOST CHERISHED</div><b>동생</b><p>세상에서 가장 아끼는 존재</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="place"><strong>서울특별시 송파구</strong><span>BASED IN · SEOUL</span></div>
      <p class="note">위치는 공개된 자기소개 정보 중 구 단위까지만 표시했습니다.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><h2>온라인에서 만나요</h2><span class="index">03 / DIGITAL</span></div>
      <div class="links">
        <a class="link" href="https://github.com/tndk0512-ux" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="symbol">GH ↗</span><b>GitHub</b><small>github.com/tndk0512-ux</small>
        </a>
        <a class="link" href="https://tndk0512-ux.github.io/index/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="symbol">WEB ↗</span><b>GitHub Pages</b><small>tndk0512-ux.github.io/index/</small>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="note">프로필에 등록된 개인 GitHub와 페이지 링크로 연결됩니다.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><h2>나를 이루는 키워드</h2><span class="index">04 / KEYWORDS</span></div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px">
        <span style="padding:10px 14px;background:#e8eee4;border-radius:30px;color:#496b58;font-size:13px">#기타</span>
        <span style="padding:10px 14px;background:#f8e9df;border-radius:30px;color:#a65d3d;font-size:13px">#애니메이션</span>
        <span style="padding:10px 14px;background:#e5eef0;border-radius:30px;color:#557985;font-size:13px">#음악</span>
        <span style="padding:10px 14px;background:#efeee6;border-radius:30px;color:#666b5e;font-size:13px">#가족</span>
        <span style="padding:10px 14px;background:#e8eee4;border-radius:30px;color:#496b58;font-size:13px">#창작</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note">취미와 소중한 것 항목에서 추출한 키워드를 시각적으로 정리했습니다. ‘창작’은 관심사에 대한 해석입니다.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="profile-footer">
    <div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#c6d77c">A NOTE ABOUT ME</div><strong>좋아하는 것들을 모아,<br>나만의 방향으로.</strong></div>
    <p>이 페이지는 제공된 자기소개 표의<br>윤수아 항목을 바탕으로 제작했습니다.</p>
  </section>
  <footer class="footer"><span>PERSONAL DATA ATLAS · SOOAH YOON</span><span>MADE WITH MY DATA / 2026</span></footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
